{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10215","headline":"暮春宜阳郡斋愁坐忽枉刘七侍御新诗因以酬答 · 李嘉佑","name":"暮春宜阳郡斋愁坐忽枉刘七侍御新诗因以酬答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子规夜夜[啼]槠叶，远道逢春半是愁。\n芳草伴人还易老，落花随水亦东流。\n山临睥睨恒多雨，地接潇湘畏及秋。\n唯羡君爲周柱史，手持黄纸到沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}